@When "^perform equal '(\d+)' way allocation for the trade$"
    When opens lifecycle action 'allocation' for current trade
    And component allocation dialog enters split number '$1'
    And user fills $1 way sub-trade allocation info
    And component allocation dialog total pct value is 'Total: 100.00% ✓'
    And submits allocation event and waits for allocation response

@When "^perform unequal '(\d+)' way allocation for the trade$"
    When opens lifecycle action 'allocation' for current trade
    And component allocation dialog enters split number '$1'
    And user fills $1 way sub-trade allocation info
    And component allocation dialog total pct value is 'Total: 100.00% ✓'
    And submits allocation event and waits for allocation response

@When "^submits allocation event and waits for allocation response$"
    When component dynamic action clicks confirm button
    And component trade change confirmation dialog is visible
    And component trade change confirmation types comments from stored variable 'comments'
    And user confirms allocation and waits for allocation response

@Then "^the allocation is completed successfully$"
    Then assert toast notification with type 'success' and message from stored variable 'toastMessage'

@Then "^the trade is allocated to Dead in the trade details$"
    When navigate to trade details for stored trade 'createdTradeId'
    Then page trade detail status badge shows 'DEAD'
